<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>TWZ</title><link>https://www.twz.com</link><description>防御世界的强大进攻。</description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 03:29:34 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>退役的 KC-10 延长加油机已从坟场重新飞翔</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/retired-kc-10-extender-tanker-has-risen-from-boneyard-to-fly-again</link><description>&lt;p&gt;前美国空军 KC-10 现已在私营部门欧米茄空中加油公司开启第二职业生涯。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/retired-kc-10-extender-tanker-has-risen-from-boneyard-to-fly-again"&gt;退役后的 KC-10 扩展加油机已从埋葬场重新飞翔，&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 23:07:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/retired-kc-10-extender-tanker-has-risen-from-boneyard-to-fly-again</guid></item><item><title>乌克兰主要武器制造商重新考虑未来对星链的依赖</title><link>https://www.twz.com/news-features/major-ukrainian-arms-maker-rethinking-future-reliance-on-starlink</link><description>&lt;p&gt;降低使用星链的武器的运行速度会影响关键的防御和进攻武器，但任何替代方案都有巨大的缺点。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/news-features/major-ukrainian-arms-maker-rethinking-future-reliance-on-starlink"&gt;乌克兰主要武器制造商重新思考未来对星链的依赖一文&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 21:30:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/news-features/major-ukrainian-arms-maker-rethinking-future-reliance-on-starlink</guid></item><item><title>俄罗斯威胁迫在眉睫 芬兰将埋设百万枚地雷</title><link>https://www.twz.com/news-features/finland-plans-to-build-a-million-landmines-as-russian-threat-looms</link><description>&lt;p&gt;随着俄罗斯重建其在北约北翼的军事态势，赫尔辛基正着手重启国内曾经被禁止的杀伤人员地雷的生产。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/news-features/finland-plans-to-build-a-million-landmines-as-russian-threat-looms"&gt;俄罗斯威胁迫在眉睫时，芬兰将建造一百万枚地雷，&lt;/a&gt;该帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 20:53:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/news-features/finland-plans-to-build-a-million-landmines-as-russian-threat-looms</guid></item><item><title>阿拉斯加的 HAARP 站点现已用于测试新型空军超视距雷达技术</title><link>https://www.twz.com/news-features/alaskas-haarp-site-now-being-used-to-test-new-air-force-over-the-horizon-radar-tech</link><description>&lt;p&gt;利用超视距雷达来监视战略高北地区可能会为 HAARP 站点带来新的作用。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/news-features/alaskas-haarp-site-now-being-used-to-test-new-air-force-over-the-horizon-radar-tech"&gt;阿拉斯加的 HAARP 站点现已用于测试新型空军超视距雷达技术，&lt;/a&gt;该消息首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 18:55:29 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/news-features/alaskas-haarp-site-now-being-used-to-test-new-air-force-over-the-horizon-radar-tech</guid></item><item><title>幽灵鲨超大型无人水下航行器的有效载荷舱首次亮相</title><link>https://www.twz.com/sea/ghost-shark-extra-large-uncrewed-underwater-vehicles-payload-bay-seen-for-first-time</link><description>&lt;p&gt;作为澳大利亚新海底武器库的一部分，“幽灵鲨鱼”将部署无人机、埋设水雷并执行海底补给任务。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/sea/ghost-shark-extra-large-uncrewed-underwater-vehicles-payload-bay-seen-for-first-time"&gt;首次看到“幽灵鲨”超大型无人水下航行器的有效载荷舱的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 16:53:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/sea/ghost-shark-extra-large-uncrewed-underwater-vehicles-payload-bay-seen-for-first-time</guid></item><item><title>俄罗斯卫星对一颗非常特殊的雷达成像卫星进行前所未有的跟踪是一件大事</title><link>https://www.twz.com/news-features/russias-satellite-unprecedented-shadowing-of-a-very-particular-radar-imaging-satellite-is-a-big-deal</link><description>&lt;p&gt;俄罗斯的 Kosmos 2612 经过数周极不寻常的机动后，非常接近 ICEYE X36，据报道，ICEYE X36 与乌克兰有联系。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/news-features/russias-satellite-unprecedented-shadowing-of-a-very-particular-radar-imaging-satellite-is-a-big-deal"&gt;俄罗斯卫星对一颗非常特殊的雷达成像卫星进行前所未有的跟踪是一件大事，&lt;/a&gt;该帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 21:38:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/news-features/russias-satellite-unprecedented-shadowing-of-a-very-particular-radar-imaging-satellite-is-a-big-deal</guid></item><item><title>德国放弃波音 MQ-28“幽灵蝙蝠”快速采购计划</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/germany-drops-boeing-mq-28-ghost-bat-rapid-procurement-plan</link><description>&lt;p&gt;针对德国 CCA 要求的更广泛竞争现在可能会延续到下一个十年。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/germany-drops-boeing-mq-28-ghost-bat-rapid-procurement-plan"&gt;德国放弃波音 MQ-28 幽灵蝙蝠快速采购计划&lt;/a&gt;后首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 21:32:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/germany-drops-boeing-mq-28-ghost-bat-rapid-procurement-plan</guid></item><item><title>如果未来爆发冲突，陆军计划向敌方领土发射数百个气球</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/armys-plan-to-launch-hundreds-of-balloons-into-enemy-territory-if-a-future-conflict-breaks-out</link><description>&lt;p&gt;这些气球将用于监视敌方大片领土、诱饵防御、提供网络以及在敌后发起无人机攻击。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/armys-plan-to-launch-hundreds-of-balloons-into-enemy-territory-if-a-future-conflict-breaks-out"&gt;陆军计划在未来爆发冲突时向敌方领土发射数百个气球的帖子&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 19:49:31 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/armys-plan-to-launch-hundreds-of-balloons-into-enemy-territory-if-a-future-conflict-breaks-out</guid></item><item><title>我们终于知道 B-21 袭击者的真实翼展</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/we-finally-know-the-b-21-raiders-true-wingspan</link><description>&lt;p&gt;我们不必再忍受 B-21 尺寸小得离奇的估计。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/we-finally-know-the-b-21-raiders-true-wingspan"&gt;我们终于知道 B-21 袭击者的真实翼展的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 17:50:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/we-finally-know-the-b-21-raiders-true-wingspan</guid></item><item><title>无人机似乎正在乌克兰战场上运送伤员</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/aerial-drones-appear-to-be-picking-up-wounded-off-the-battlefield-in-ukraine</link><description>&lt;p&gt;一架重型六轴直升机将一名受伤士兵从乌克兰所说的无人机杀伤区中拉出，这将是世界首例。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/aerial-drones-appear-to-be-picking-up-wounded-off-the-battlefield-in-ukraine"&gt;空中无人机似乎正在从乌克兰战场上捡起伤员，&lt;/a&gt;该帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 16:47:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/aerial-drones-appear-to-be-picking-up-wounded-off-the-battlefield-in-ukraine</guid></item></channel></rss>